WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:05.644
Modulation moves parameters for you, so the picture keeps changing on its own.

2
00:00:05.644 --> 00:00:07.419
Open the Modulation section.

3
00:00:07.870 --> 00:00:09.662
Classic mode has four slots.

4
00:00:09.662 --> 00:00:13.758
Each is a function generator: a source, a target, and an amount.

5
00:00:14.215 --> 00:00:16.746
Slot one's source is already a sine wave.

6
00:00:16.746 --> 00:00:18.289
Set its target to Z Push.

7
00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:19.913
Switch the slot on.

8
00:00:20.377 --> 00:00:21.972
Amount is how far it swings.

9
00:00:21.972 --> 00:00:24.537
Turn it up, and the raster starts to breathe.

10
00:00:24.991 --> 00:00:26.621
Expand the slot for more.

11
00:00:26.621 --> 00:00:29.556
Rate sets how fast the wave cycles, in hertz.

12
00:00:30.283 --> 00:00:34.573
This slot also appears in the Patch Bay as Function Generator one.

13
00:00:34.573 --> 00:00:35.808
Next: the Timeline.
